-- What the status function answers with.
-- gloss (not the text's): `shown repealed` and `shown repealed in part` are the site's own labels, as the extract
-- reports them; `no repeal annotation shown` is not a statement that the chapter is in force.
DECLARE `Chapter status` IS ONE OF
    `shown repealed` HAS entry IS A STRING
    `shown repealed in part` HAS entry IS A STRING
    `no repeal annotation shown`
    `outside the cc. 1-37 the extract names`

